Cell["\<\
The co-bracket, on the right, cuts one string into two; the strings propagate \
from the top to the bottom, and the red curve is the pairing that annihilates \
two particles of the word:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"a773e9cf-0e90-4c32-91e0-87d0aca7071d"],

